; Journal for the positive cases of test/regress/3290.test, whose own
; inline journal is the failing one.  Nor can it be a .test of its own:
; the Lean oracle that test/semantic/check_all.py runs reads no comparison
; in an amount expression, `!=` included, and check_all.py fails on any
; inline positive journal that the oracle cannot read.

2025-01-01 Equal
    Expenses:Food    (1 == 1 ? $10.00 : $20.00) = $10.00
    Assets:Cash

2025-01-02 Unequal
    Expenses:Food    (1 == 2 ? $10.00 : $20.00) = $30.00
    Assets:Cash

2025-01-03 Broker
    Assets:Brokerage    10 AAPL @ (2 == 2 ? $50.00 : $60.00) = 10 AAPL
    Assets:Cash
